Description: Plugin host (LV2, VST3 and CLAP) for playing a MIDI keyboard live
 An instrument rack for playing live from a MIDI keyboard: LV2, VST3 and CLAP
 instruments and effects in a few parallel slots, each with its own keyboard
 zone, presets and scenes, and a sampled grand piano of its own (its samples are
 downloaded from within the app). Contains the app (live-keys-gui) and a
 headless command-line host (live-keys).

